<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>IGNIS Solutions — Demo Mejorada</title>
<style>
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

:root {
  --navy:    #060d1f;
  --navy-2:  #0b1528;
  --navy-3:  #0f1d36;
  --cyan:    #00c8ff;
  --cyan-glow: rgba(0,200,255,0.18);
  --white:   #ffffff;
  --gray:    rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
}

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scrollbar-width: none; }
html::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

body {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--white);
  font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  cursor: none;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

/* ── CURSOR ── */
.cursor {
  position: fixed; width: 10px; height: 10px;
  background: var(--cyan); border-radius: 50%;
  pointer-events: none; z-index: 9999;
  transform: translate(-50%,-50%);
  transition: width .25s, height .25s, background .25s;
}
.cursor-ring {
  position: fixed; width: 38px; height: 38px;
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(0,200,255,.45); border-radius: 50%;
  pointer-events: none; z-index: 9998;
  transform: translate(-50%,-50%);
  transition: width .3s, height .3s, opacity .3s;
}
body:has(a:hover) .cursor,
body:has(button:hover) .cursor { width: 18px; height: 18px; background: white; }
body:has(a:hover) .cursor-ring,
body:has(button:hover) .cursor-ring { width: 56px; height: 56px; opacity: .6; }

/* ── PROGRESS BAR ── */
#progress-bar {
  position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; height: 2px;
  background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--cyan), #0060ff);
  z-index: 200; width: 0%;
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--cyan);
  transition: width .08s linear;
}

/* ── NAV ── */
nav {
  position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
  padding: 22px 64px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  transition: padding .35s, background .35s, border-color .35s, transform .35s ease;
  border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
}
nav.hidden {
  transform: translateY(-100%) !important;
}
nav.scrolled {
  padding: 14px 64px;
  background: rgba(6,13,31,.88);
  backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
  border-color: rgba(0,200,255,.08);
}
.nav-logo {
  font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  color: white; text-decoration: none;
}
.nav-logo span { color: var(--cyan); }
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 32px; align-items: center; }
.nav-links a {
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.65); text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 500;
  transition: color .2s;
}
.nav-links a:hover { color: white; }
.btn-cta {
  background: var(--cyan); color: #000;
  padding: 9px 22px; border-radius: 8px;
  font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: .5px;
  text-decoration: none; transition: all .2s;
}
.btn-cta:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,200,255,.45);
  color: #000 !important;
}

/* ── HERO ── */
.hero {
  position: relative; z-index: 2;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex; align-items: center;
  background: transparent;
}

/* ── SOBRE NOSOTROS ── */
.about-zone {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 10;
  height: 180vh;
  margin-top: -95vh;
  background: transparent;
}
.about-sticky {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  height: 100vh;
  overflow: hidden;
  pointer-events: none;
  background: transparent;
}
.about-card {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0; right: 0;
  width: 44vw;
  height: 40px;
  background: var(--navy-3);
  border-radius: 16px 0 0 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  pointer-events: all;
  will-change: width, height, border-radius;
}
.about-inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 64px;
  height: 100%;
}
.about-tag {
  font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 3px;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--cyan); margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.about-card h2 {
  font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 44px); font-weight: 900;
  line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -1.5px; margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.about-card h2 .acc { color: var(--cyan); }
.about-card p {
  color: var(--gray); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.about-stats {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
  gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px;
}
.about-stat {
  background: rgba(0,200,255,.05);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,200,255,.12);
  border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; text-align: center;
}
.about-stat-num {
  font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--cyan); letter-spacing: -2px; line-height: 1;
}
.about-stat-lbl { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--gray); margin-top: 4px; }
.about-photo {
  position: relative; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;
  aspect-ratio: 4/3; background: var(--navy-2);
}
.about-photo-placeholder {
  width: 100%; height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center;
  justify-content: center; color: rgba(255,255,255,.2); font-size: 14px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy-2), var(--navy-3));
  min-height: 260px;
}
#particles { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; }
.orb {
  position: absolute; border-radius: 50%;
  filter: blur(90px); pointer-events: none;
}
.orb-1 { width: 480px; height: 480px; background: #0050c8; opacity: .18; top: -160px; right: -80px; }
.orb-2 { width: 320px; height: 320px; background: var(--cyan); opacity: .10; bottom: 60px; left: -80px; }

.hero-inner {
  position: relative; z-index: 2;
  padding: 0 64px; max-width: 860px;
}

.hero-badge {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
  background: rgba(0,200,255,.09);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,200,255,.28);
  padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 100px;
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--cyan);
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}
.hero-badge::before {
  content: ''; width: 6px; height: 6px;
  background: var(--cyan); border-radius: 50%;
  animation: blink-dot 2s infinite;
}
@keyframes blink-dot {
  0%,100% { opacity:1; box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(0,200,255,.5); }
  50% { opacity:.5; box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(0,200,255,0); }
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px);
  font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1;
  letter-spacing: -1.5px; margin-bottom: 0;
}
.hero h1 .outline {
  color: transparent;
  -webkit-text-stroke: 2px rgba(0,200,255,.6);
}
.hero h1 .typed-wrap {
  color: var(--cyan);
}
.typed-line {
  display: block;
  min-height: 1.5em;
  margin-top: 2px;
  line-height: 1.1;
}
.typed-wrap {
  font-size: 1.4em;
  color: var(--cyan);
  display: inline;
}
.cursor-blink {
  display: inline-block; width: 3px;
  background: var(--cyan); margin-left: 3px;
  animation: blink-cur .75s step-end infinite;
  vertical-align: middle; height: 1em;
  font-size: 1.4em;
  position: relative; top: -1px;
}
@keyframes blink-cur { 50% { opacity: 0; } }

.hero-sub {
  font-size: 15px; color: var(--gray);
  line-height: 1.6; max-width: 520px;
  margin-top: 18px; margin-bottom: 28px;
}
.hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

.btn-primary {
  background: var(--cyan); color: #000;
  padding: 14px 30px; border-radius: 10px;
  font-weight: 700; font-size: 14.5px;
  text-decoration: none; border: none;
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  transition: all .25s; cursor: none;
}
.btn-primary:hover {
  transform: translateY(-3px);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 32px rgba(0,200,255,.45);
  background: #1ad4ff;
}
.btn-outline {
  background: transparent; color: white;
  padding: 14px 30px; border-radius: 10px;
  font-weight: 600; font-size: 14.5px;
  text-decoration: none;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
  transition: all .25s; cursor: none;
}
.btn-outline:hover {
  border-color: rgba(0,200,255,.45);
  color: var(--cyan);
  background: rgba(0,200,255,.05);
}

.scroll-hint {
  position: absolute; bottom: 24px; left: 64px; z-index: 2;
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
  font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 2.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,.35);
}
.scroll-hint::before {
  content: '';
  display: inline-block; width: 0; height: 1px;
  background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--cyan));
  animation: expand-line 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes expand-line {
  0% { width: 0; opacity: 0; }
  50% { width: 36px; opacity: 1; }
  100% { width: 36px; opacity: 0; }
}

/* ── LOGO CAROUSEL ── */
.logos-strip {
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);
  background: var(--navy-2);
  padding: 32px 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 10;
}
.logos-strip::before,
.logos-strip::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 120px; z-index: 2;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.logos-strip::before {
  left: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(6,13,31,1), transparent);
}
.logos-strip::after {
  right: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(to left, rgba(6,13,31,1), transparent);
}
.logos-track {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0;
  width: max-content;
  animation: marquee 28s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes marquee {
  from { transform: translateX(0); }
  to   { transform: translateX(-50%); }
}
.logo-item {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  padding: 0 52px;
  border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  height: 80px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.logo-item img {
  height: 54px;
  width: auto;
  max-width: 150px;
  object-fit: contain;
}

/* ── SERVICES ── */
.services { padding: 100px 64px; position: relative; z-index: 10; background: var(--navy); }

.sec-tag {
  font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 3px;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--cyan);
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.sec-tag::before { content: ''; width: 22px; height: 2px; background: var(--cyan); }

.sec-title {
  font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 58px); font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: -1.8px; line-height: 1.08; margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.sec-title .acc { color: var(--cyan); }

.sec-sub { color: var(--gray); font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 520px; }

.cards-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
  gap: 20px; margin-top: 60px;
}

.card {
  position: relative;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.03);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
  border-radius: 20px; padding: 40px;
  overflow: hidden; transition: border-color .35s, box-shadow .35s;
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
  opacity: 0; transform: translateY(36px);
  transition: opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease, border-color .3s, box-shadow .3s;
}
.card.visible {
  opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) perspective(800px) rotateX(0) rotateY(0);
}
.card::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at var(--mx, 50%) var(--my, 50%), rgba(0,200,255,.07), transparent 60%);
  border-radius: 20px; opacity: 0; transition: opacity .3s;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
.card:hover {
  border-color: rgba(0,200,255,.25);
  box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0,200,255,.07), inset 0 0 40px rgba(0,200,255,.03);
}

.card-icon {
  width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 13px;
  background: rgba(0,200,255,.1); display: flex; align-items: center;
  justify-content: center; font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px;
  transition: background .3s, box-shadow .3s;
}
.card:hover .card-icon {
  background: rgba(0,200,255,.18);
  box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(0,200,255,.25);
}
.card h3 { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: -.3px; }
.card p { color: var(--gray); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 22px; }
.tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
.t {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.05);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
  padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 6px;
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .5px; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.55);
  transition: all .2s;
}
.card:hover .t {
  background: rgba(0,200,255,.1);
  border-color: rgba(0,200,255,.22);
  color: var(--cyan);
}

/* ── PROCESS — scrollytelling ── */
.process { background: var(--navy-2); padding: 100px 64px; position: relative; z-index: 10; }
.process-inner {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start;
}
.process-left { position: sticky; top: 110px; }

.process-steps { margin-top: 52px; }
.step {
  display: flex; gap: 22px; padding: 26px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);
  opacity: .3; transition: opacity .45s;
}
.step.active { opacity: 1; }
.step-n {
  font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--cyan);
  letter-spacing: 1px; min-width: 28px; padding-top: 3px;
}
.step-body h4 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 7px; }
.step-body p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.65; }

/* Active step cyan left border */
.step { border-left: 2px solid transparent; padding-left: 18px; transition: opacity .45s, border-color .45s; }
.step.active { border-color: var(--cyan); }

/* ── STACK ── */
.stack { padding: 100px 64px; background: var(--navy); position: relative; z-index: 10; }
.stack-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; }

.cat { margin-bottom: 28px; }
.cat-label {
  font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 3px;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--cyan); margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 9px; }
.pill {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  padding: 7px 15px; border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75);
  transition: all .25s; cursor: none;
}
.pill:hover {
  background: rgba(0,200,255,.12);
  border-color: rgba(0,200,255,.28);
  color: var(--cyan);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.skill { margin-bottom: 22px; }
.skill-hdr {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
  font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 9px;
}
.skill-hdr span:last-child { color: var(--cyan); }
.track {
  height: 3px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.07);
  border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden;
}
.fill {
  height: 100%; width: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--cyan), #005fff);
  border-radius: 2px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,200,255,.5);
  transition: width 1.3s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);
}

/* ── CTA ── */
.cta {
  position: relative; z-index: 10; overflow: hidden;
  padding: 130px 64px; text-align: center;
  background: var(--navy);
}
.cta-glow {
  position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 55% at 50% 50%, rgba(0,200,255,.09), transparent 70%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.cta h2 {
  font-size: clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 72px); font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: -2.5px; line-height: 1.05;
  margin-bottom: 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;
}
.cta p {
  color: var(--gray); font-size: 16.5px;
  margin-bottom: 44px; position: relative; z-index: 2;
}
.cta-btns {
  display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 14px;
  position: relative; z-index: 2; flex-wrap: wrap;
}

/* ── FADE-UP UTILITY ── */
.fu {
  opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);
  transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;
}
.fu.d1 { transition-delay: .1s; }
.fu.d2 { transition-delay: .2s; }
.fu.d3 { transition-delay: .3s; }
.fu.vis { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }


/* ── LOADER ── */
#loader-bg {
  position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 9000;
  background: var(--navy);
  transition: transform 1s cubic-bezier(.76,0,.24,1);
}
#loader-bg.exit { transform: translateY(100%); }

#loader-content {
  position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 9001;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  flex-direction: column;
  transition: transform .5s ease, opacity .5s ease;
  pointer-events: none;
}
#loader-content.exit {
  transform: translateY(30px);
  opacity: 0;
}

.l-num {
  font-size: 140px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -8px;
  color: white; line-height: 1;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.l-bar-wrap { width: 220px; margin: 24px 0 18px; }
.l-bar-track {
  height: 1.5px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden;
}
.l-bar-fill {
  height: 100%; width: 0%;
  background: var(--cyan);
  border-radius: 2px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--cyan);
}
.l-lbl {
  font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 4px;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.35); text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* ── HERO ENTRANCE ── */
.he {
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(40px);
  transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
}
.he.in { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="loader-bg"></div>
<div id="loader-content">
  <div class="l-num" id="lNum">0</div>
  <div class="l-bar-wrap">
    <div class="l-bar-track"><div class="l-bar-fill" id="lFill"></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="l-lbl">Cargando</div>
</div>


<div id="progress-bar"></div>
<div class="cursor" id="cur"></div>
<div class="cursor-ring" id="ring"></div>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav id="nav" class="he">
  <a href="#" class="nav-logo">IGNIS <span>Solutions.</span></a>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="#">Nosotros</a>
    <a href="#">Servicios</a>
    <a href="#">Stack</a>
    <a href="#">Trabaja con nosotros</a>
    <a href="#" class="btn-cta">CONTACTO</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <canvas id="particles"></canvas>
  <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
  <div class="orb orb-2"></div>

  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1 class="he">
      Tu próximo producto<br>
      digital, <span style="white-space:nowrap">construido por</span>
      <span class="typed-line">
        <span class="typed-wrap" id="typed"></span><span class="cursor-blink"></span>
      </span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub he">
      Transformamos ideas en productos digitales que escalan. Metodologías ágiles,
      arquitecturas modernas y un equipo que domina cada línea de código.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions he">
      <a href="#" class="btn-primary">Ver casos de éxito <span>→</span></a>
      <a href="#" class="btn-outline">Hablá con el equipo</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="scroll-hint he">scroll</div>
</section>

<!-- SOBRE NOSOTROS -->
<div class="about-zone" id="aboutZone">
  <div class="about-sticky">
    <div class="about-card" id="aboutCard">
      <div class="about-inner" id="aboutInner">
        <div>
          <div class="about-tag">Sobre Nosotros</div>
          <h2>
            Construimos el <span class="acc">futuro</span><br>
            digital de tu <span class="acc">empresa</span>
          </h2>
          <p>Somos una software factory argentina con ADN tecnológico. Combinamos metodologías ágiles, arquitecturas modernas y un equipo apasionado para entregar soluciones digitales que generan impacto real.</p>
          <p>Desde startups hasta corporaciones, acompañamos cada etapa del ciclo de vida del producto, desde la ideación hasta el escalamiento en producción.</p>
          <div class="about-stats">
            <div class="about-stat">
              <div class="about-stat-num"><span class="cnt" data-t="8">0</span>+</div>
              <div class="about-stat-lbl">Años de experiencia</div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stat">
              <div class="about-stat-num"><span class="cnt" data-t="120">0</span>+</div>
              <div class="about-stat-lbl">Proyectos entregados</div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stat">
              <div class="about-stat-num"><span class="cnt" data-t="40">0</span>+</div>
              <div class="about-stat-lbl">Clientes activos</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-photo">
